<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT PERU 7-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT PERU 7-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Bolivia 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Peru</p>
<p>7-0 (halftime 4-0) in a Copa America semi-final Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Denilson (2), Flavio Conceicao (28), Romario (36,</p>
<p>48), Leonardo (45, 61), Djalminha (78)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
